The clips in this folder are screen recordings by Daniel Owsianski, released under the
MIT License of this repository (see ../../LICENSE).

They show the user interface of SolidCraft (https://github.com/tangency-labs/solidcraft),
licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0. Captions and key labels are drawn with IBM Plex Sans Condensed
and Fira Code, both under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
